  "title": "Qualify isolated source-free Math symbolics and codecs consumers",
  "commitMessage": "docs: qualify fresh offline Math symbolics and codec consumers",
  "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
  "projectNodes": [
    "M7"
  ],
  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Freshly qualify two existing net10 NuGet-only Math clients on current-source symbolics and codecs without publication. Rebuild four packages, inspect local ZIP/nuspec/SHA identities and rerun 32 M4 symbolic-domain and 8 M5 Markdown/OMML independent probes from a private offline feed. Preserve all 541 completed DWF nodes.",
    "value": "A read-only C# BCL gate checks four exact package dependencies, both source-free clients and clear-only NuGet configs, 541 unchanged nodes and RS127's two pre-attempt refusals (first-pass NO). Twelve local commands restore/build, pack and independently inspect four preview archives and run the two consumers with an isolated cache. The receipt records four fresh SHA-256 archive identities and forty independently passing probes without claiming public release, cross-version ABI, general CAS/Office conversion or recipient adoption.",
    "nextAction": "After RS128 success, consider further bounded source-free consumers or version-pinned ABI evidence where real prior binaries exist. Public NuGet, Discovery skill, AURA/Decision/MCDM migration and M8 remain separately owner gated.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "32 symbolic and 8 codec/OMML probes do not certify theorem proving, universal algebra, full Word documents or typography fidelity.",
      "Four local nupkg digests and two consumers do not prove stable cross-version ABI, future builds or alternate RIDs.",
      "The three external recipient requests remain unsent; release rights and generated Math Discovery skill are not approved.",
      "RS128 is evidence-only, with zero achievements; the completed 541-node M0–M7 roadmap remains unchanged."
    ],
    "achievements": []
  },
